  pi          Diagnose, install, remove, or restore the native Pi integration
  control-plane  Operate durable runs, calls, approvals, and evidence
  claim       Verify the checked-in promotion contract without changing it
  setup       Prove core mechanisms, discover hosts, or explicitly onboard one host
  onboard     Safely onboard one supported host with explicit consent
  launch      Compatibility-gate and start one onboarded coding-agent host
  activate    Activate MAINFRAME for an AI host (merge-safe, --dry-run)
  deactivate  Remove MAINFRAME-managed activation content
